The discounted price of the shorts is \(35 - 10.50 = \$24.50\).  

The total cost for both items after discount is \(17.50 + 24.50 = \$42.00\).  

Since sales tax is included, no additional tax is applied.  
Joe has $50 - $42.00 = $8.00 left.  

